{"text": "Apprndix AA - Corporate Communications\n\nps2\n\ni\n!\n\nMEMORANDUM\nTo: All Deep Mine Superintendents\nFROM: Don Blankenship\nDATE: October 19, 2005\nSUBJECT: RUNNING COAL\n\nIf any of you have been asked by your group presidents, your supervisors, engineers or anyone\n\u2018else to do anything other than run coal (i.e. \u2014 bulld overcasts, do construction jobs, or\nwhatever), you need to ignore them and run coal. This memo is necessary only because We\n\u2018seem not to understand that the coal pays the ills.\nDiB:sia\n\ncc: Chris Adkins\nDrexel Short\n\n(aietated, nt edited)\n\nARACOMAORSS!",
